e, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-10 17:23:54+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 114952}, {"content": "Tell me about Rydens job interview?", "country": "The Netherlands", "hashed_ip": "c329287384786477e0a711474a2dfccd62ddfe18fcbed769a987aa9b003c8959", "header": {"accept-language": "en-US,en;q=0.5", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; rv:102.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/102.0"}, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "North Holland", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 114955}, {"content": "In the movie Post Grad, Ryden (Alexis Bledel) has an important job interview for a position at a prestigious publishing company. She spends hours preparing for the interview, practicing her answers to common questions and studying the company's history and values. On the day of the interview, Ryden arrives dressed professionally and feeling confident. However, her confidence quickly fades when she realizes the interviewer is her old college nemesis, Jessica (Catherine Reitman). During the interview, Jessica questions Ryden's lack of experience and suggests that Ryden should have pursued a more practical major, like business or accounting. Ryden struggles to defend herself and becomes increasingly flustered. As she leaves the interview, she accidentally spills coffee on her blazer, adding insult to injury. Despite this setback, Ryden refuses to give up on her dreams and continues to search for her ideal career path.", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-10 17:24:22+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 114955}, {"content": "What is Ryden wearing during the interview?", "country": "The Netherlands", "hashed_ip": "4eceec66802aa0fbc942035b91a193a1f1015d29572779f60da5cdb7642d6e5a", "header": {"accept-language": "en-US,en;q=0.5", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; rv:102.0